    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eshimenyo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khudi, okhole eshimenyo netsingubo tsinzeleesia ekhumi; otsikhole ikitani indorotoro isiire, netsingubo tsieibuluu, netsieisambarau, netsiranzayi; nende abakerubi, emilimo chiomulushi amang'oole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oburambi bwabuli ngubo inzelesia bube emikhono amakhumi kabili nanlunaane, nobubambalifu bwabuli ngubo inzeleesia emikhono chine; tsingubo tsinzeleesia tsiosi tsibe etsieshichelo shilala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsingubo tsinzeleesia tsiraano tsiungwe halala, buli ngubo khuyindi; khandi etsindi tsingubo tsinzeleesia tsiraano tsiungwe, buli ngubo khuyindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhole ebifuulwaS bieibuluu khundulo weingubo inzeleesia eyihelelesia khutsiunjilwe etsiambeli; khandi okhole orio ebifuulwa khundulo weingubo inzeleesia eyihelelesia khutsiunjilwe tsiakhabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhole ebifuukva amakhumi karaano khungubo inzeleesia ndala, khandi okhole ebifuulwa amakhumi karaano khundulo weingubo inzeleesia eyili mutsiunjilwe tsiakhabili; ebifuulwa ebio bihengane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi okhole ebitiili amakhumi karaano keitsahaabu, wungasie ingubo inzeleesia ndala khuyindi nebitiili bienebio; mana eshimenyo shibe shilala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhole tsingubo tsinzeleesia tsiobwoya bwetsimbusi, tsibe liheema hekulu weshimenyo; okhole tsingubo tsinzeleesia ekhumi nandala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oburambi bwabuli ngubo inzeleesia bube emikhono amakhumi kataru, nobubambalifu bwabuli ngubo inzeleesia emikhono chine; tsingubo tsinzeleesia etsio ekhumi nandala tsibe etsieshichelo shilala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wunje tsingubo tsinzeleesia tsiraano khubwatsio, khandi tsingubo tsinzeleesia tsisasaba khubwatsio, nofumba eyakhasasabu yibe shikhabili imbeli weliheema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhole nende ebifuulwa amakhumi kataano khundulo weingubo inzeleesia ndala eyihelelesia khutsiunjilwe tsiambeli etsio, khandi ebifuulwa amakhumi karaano khundulo weingubo inzeleesia khutsiunjilwe tsiakhabili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi okhole ebitiili amakhumi karaano ebiomukasa, niwinjisia ebitiili mubifuulwa, niwungasia liheema halala, libe elala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne eshitonye eshitong'a khutsingubo tsinzeleesia tsieliheema, eshieleela, mbu inusu yeingubo inzeleesia eyo eyitong'a, yeleele khushimenyo indangu Washio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne oburambi bwomukhono obwokhulubeka lulala, nende oburambi bwomukhono obwokhulubeka lundi, khubwenobwo obutong'a khuburambi bwetsingubo tsinzeleesia tsieliheema, bweleele khushimenyo elubeka eyi nende eyi, okhulifuunikha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhole nende eshifuunikho shieliheema shiamaseelo kamamiiku akanyushilwa iranji iranzayi, khandi nende eshifuunikho shiamaseelo kandi amanyushe ikulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhole ebitiisil bieshimenyo, emisaala chiomupeeli, ebisinjila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oburambi bweshitiisi bube emikhono ekhumi, khandi obuchiikha bwabuli shitiisi bube omukhono neinusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwanzo rubeho rubili khubuli shitiisi, niruungasibwa; nindio okhole ebitiisi biosi bieshimenyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhole ebitiisi bieshimenyo, ebitiisi amakhumi kabili khulubeka Iwomukhono musaatsa okuhenjile enasautsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhole nende ebichibi amakhumi kane ebieifeetsa hasi webitiisi ebio amakhumi kabili; ebichibi bibili hasi weshitiisi shilala khulwa orwanzo rwashio rubili, khandi ebichibi bibili hasi weshitiisi shindi khulwa orwanzo rwashio rubili; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khandi khulubeka lwakhabili Iweshimenyo, khulubeka Iwenotsi, ebitiisi amakhumi kabili; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nebichibi biabio bieifeetsa amakhumi kane; ebichibi bibili hasi weshitiisi shilala, khandi ebichibi bibili hasi weshitiisi shindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khulwa olubeka Iweindangu Iweshimenyo, olubeka lwamumbo, okhole ebitiisi bisasaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhole nende ebitiisi bibili ebietsikoona tsieshimenyo indangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hasi biliimaasibwe shikhabili, khandi biliimaasibwe shikhabili birio okhuula khumurwe washio, okhuula khungaka yambeli; nindio bilaba biombi; bibe ebietsikoona etsio tsibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bibeho ebitiisi munaane, nebichibi biabio bieifeetsa, ebichibi ekhumi nabisasaba; ebichibi bibili hasi weshitiisi shilala, khandi ebichibi bibili hasi weshitiisi shindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khatdi okhole tsisheti tsiomupeeli; tsiraano tsiebitiisi bieshimenyo khulubeka lulala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nende tsisheti tsiraano tsiebitiisi bieshimenyo khulubeka lundi, nende tsisheti tsiraano tsiebitiisi bieshimenyo khulubeka Iweindangu, elubeka lwamumbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olusheti lwahakari nalwo, hakari webitiisi, lubirile elala okhuula khundulo eyi nende eyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ofuume ebitiisi tsana itsahaabu, nokhola tsingaka tsiabio tsieitsahaabu tsibe habundu wetsisheti; khandi tsisheti natsio otsifuume itsahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho olasinjisie eshimenyo habwene shinga omufwano kwashio okwa ndakhumanyiye mushikulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
