              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi okholele olwichi olwo tsisiilo tsiraano tsiomupeeli, notsifuuma itsahaabu; ebikuru biatsio bibe ebieitsahaabu; nosalulusia omukasa okhutsikholela ebichibi biraano.",
